1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,560
Governor.

17
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,080
(Loyalty Eternal)
Ms. Lu is an impostor.

18
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:49,160
Su Yutang deliberately got close to you.

19
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,000
She's clearly up to no good.

20
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,160
These two are witnesses.

21
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,400
My name is Rong.

22
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,040
I grew up in the theater troupe.

23
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,600
I can testify for Lady Feng.

24
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,600
The jade pendant Su Yutang wears

25
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:04,000
belonged to her late partner, Lin Kefu.

26
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,480
Why should I believe you?

27
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,000
Governor, look.

28
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:12,360
This woman is Su Yutang's accomplice.

29
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,720
A jade pendant can be stolen.

30
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,920
A birthmark can be faked.

31
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:17,320
Su Yutang may have killed Lin Kefu.

32
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,480
If the jade pendant
belonged to Lin Kefu,

33
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,840
then Su Yutang is the one
who killed your daughter.

34
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,840
Her birthmark is identical
to my daughter's.

35
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,640
Where did it come from?

36
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:31,660
=Episode 7=

37
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,480
How else could she have gotten it?

38
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,080
It must be one of Su Yutang's tricks.

39
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,800
Before a show, performers like them

40
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:41,240
always have a lead and a backup.

41
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,600
Spare me, Governor!

42
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,840
Spare me, Lady Feng!

43
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,320
I don't know anything!

44
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,400
I didn't do anything!

45
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,640
That's not what I asked.

46
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:49,960
Talk.

47
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,040
Where did the birthmark come from?

48
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,240
It was...

49
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,480
Ms...

50
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:04,880
No.

51
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,040
Young...

52
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:06,640
Young...

53
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,920
Ms.? Young? What do you mean?

54
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,760
Speak clearly.

55
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,360
What rotten luck.

56
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,640
She said it was...

57
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,840
Ms. Lu.

58
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,120
(Loyalty Eternal)
Governor.

59
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,320
She may have meant the young master.

60
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,840
I've seen this woman before,

61
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,560
in the young master's room.

62
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,520
So Shaoyun lusted after his own sister

63
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,600
and used another woman...

64
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,040
That's not true, Governor!

65
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,840
It was Ms. Lu!

66
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:00,760
She's a fake!

67
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,160
Yanyan.

68
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,960
Don't you understand yet?

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,080
Guards!

70
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,000
(Loyalty Eternal)

71
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,800
Sir!

72
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:13,400
Lady Feng is pregnant.

73
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,440
Take her back to her room.

74
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,000
Until she gives birth,

75
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,400
she is not to leave.

76
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,200
(Loyalty Eternal)

77
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:20,800
Governor!

78
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,840
It was Ms. Lu!

79
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,000
I've said it before.

80
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,800
Her surname is Lu.

81
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,840
She is my daughter.

82
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,600
From now on,

83
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,240
anyone who tries to drive us apart

84
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,880
will face military discipline.

85
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,520
Take her away.

86
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,520
Governor!

87
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,160
Su Yutang has bad intentions!

88
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,920
Keeping her close will bring disaster!

89
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,680
Governor!

90
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:40,480
(Loyalty Eternal)

91
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,120
Let go of me!

92
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:43,760
If the monkey protecting Tang Sanzang
can be replaced,

93
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,240
so can your daughter.

94
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,360
Do you know what you're saying?

95
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,360
Of course.

96
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,560
I came here today to tell you

97
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,120
Lin Kefu was your biological daughter.

98
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,560
I took you to her mourning hall.

99
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,400
You even bought her a coffin.

100
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:01,840
And Lu Shaoyun is the one
who killed your daughter.

101
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,760
Take her away.

102
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,400
Move.

103
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:17,740
(Loyalty Eternal)

104
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,440
Ms. Lu, come with us.

105
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:27,660
(Lu)

106
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:40,960
Father.

107
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,160
You still call me Father?

108
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,600
Didn't you just admit

109
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,920
you're not my daughter?

110
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,680
I just didn't want to deceive you.

111
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,560
But no one wants to be your daughter
more than I do.

112
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,600
Impossible.

113
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,240
Keeping you by my side

114
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,640
is too dangerous.

115
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,560
There's one bullet left.

116
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,760
Take it.

117
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:17,680
The person you should save it for
is Lu Shaoyun.

118
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,320
These are turbulent times.

119
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,680
I need a son.

120
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,520
Even if you won't avenge your daughter,

121
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,880
don't you care about your own life?

122
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,880
Killing Lin Kefu wasn't his real goal.

123
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,400
He's really after your life.

124
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:32,640
The son I raised may be greedy,

125
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,280
but he wouldn't turn on me.

126
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,560
If you don't believe me,

127
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,560
I can prove it.

128
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,600
Give me a chance. Put me to the test.

129
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,400
You want me to test you?

130
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,680
Yes.

131
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,520
I'll save this bullet for you.

132
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,720
Go on.

133
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,440
Let's use his plan against him.

134
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:59,000
Since your dear son wrote the script,

135
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,400
let him keep acting it out.

136
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,200
Let's see if he'll point his gun at you,

137
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:06,400
the father who raised him for 20 years.

138
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,360
But what if

139
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,600
he doesn't shoot me?

140
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,400
Then you can kill me anytime, Governor.

141
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,160
But what if he does?

142
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,560
If you're right,

143
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:30,280
then the Six-Eared Macaque may be better

144
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:33,040
suited to guard Tang Sanzang
on his journey west.

145
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,240
(Looks like taking this gamble)

146
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,400
(was the right move.)

147
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,680
Young Master.

148
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:51,640
We searched everywhere.

149
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,760
There's no sign of Xu Lili.

150
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:54,920
She dared to run?

151
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,200
She's got some nerve.

152
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:57,800
Go.

153
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,360
Keep looking.

154
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:58,880
Yes.

155
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:06,920
She's gone.

156
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,240
I told you before

157
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,120
not to bring women into
the Governor's Residence.

158
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,400
This is a critical time.

159
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,600
You need to rein in those old habits.

160
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,480
I've completed my mission.

161
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,120
When will you two honor your promise?

162
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,560
Where is it?

163
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:37,440
It's genuine.

164
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,440
It bears Iron Leopard's
great-grandfather's seal.

165
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,840
Why is there only half?

166
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,160
Where's the other half?

167
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,360
Sorry.

168
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,440
I have to protect myself too.

169
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,680
If Iron Leopard learns I betrayed him,

170
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,760
I'm dead.

171
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:52,000
So please deal with him first.

172
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,360
How dare you blackmail us?

173
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,280
Put it down.

174
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,880
How did you get it?

175
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,560
A magician never reveals her secrets.

176
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,960
If the half she has is real,

177
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,000
she must have the other half.

178
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,360
No matter how she got it,

179
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,200
if you kill her,

180
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,600
we'll never get the other half.

181
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,160
(This son of mine isn't easy to fool.)

182
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,960
(I have the Lu family's)

183
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,320
(ancestral treasure map.)

184
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,000
(I'll give you half.)

185
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,480
(Then he'll believe it's real.)

186
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,760
We'll do it her way.

187
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,040
The old man has to go sooner or later.

188
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,720
We'll do as you say.

189
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,280
We'll pick a day to make our move.

190
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,600
Once it's done,

191
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,880
you hand over the other half.

192
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:14,260
(Fancheng Railway Station)

193
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:17,520
Give me a ride.

194
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:18,480
Sure.

195
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,000
Hop in.

196
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,600
Ms. Su.

197
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,960
Where are you headed?

198
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,640
Never mind.

199
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,440
You can go.

200
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,800
You're not foolish enough

201
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:36,440
to sneak off with the treasure map,
are you?

202
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,560
Two tickets.

203
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,560
Who were you planning to leave with?

204
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,800
(If he learns about Xu Lili and Rong,)

205
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:47,080
(he'll realize Iron Leopard
already knows I'm an impostor.)

206
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,960
(And Lu Zhentian)

207
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:51,360
(may not have told him
that he knows I'm an impostor.)

208
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,280
(I can't give myself away first.)

209
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:55,920
I'm rich now.

210
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,040
One seat for me, one for my bag.

211
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:58,760
What's wrong with that?

212
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,040
Don't waste your time making plans.

213
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:03,960
Until the job is done,

214
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,320
you're not going anywhere.

215
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,440
Are you sure

216
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:19,160
you want to make our move tomorrow?

217
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:21,360
The old man will be covered in needles.

218
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,640
It's our best chance.

219
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,120
Just replace the guards
with your men tomorrow.

220
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:27,800
I will.

221
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,280
But doesn't this all seem
a little too easy?

222
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,040
You...

223
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,840
You're always so suspicious.

224
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,760
The longer we wait,
the more can go wrong.

225
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,320
The sooner we finish this,

226
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:42,080
the sooner we can achieve
our grand ambitions.

227
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:43,920
No.

228
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,640
In case it's a trap,

229
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,040
we need a way out.

230
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:11,000
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

231
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:16,000
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

232
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,620
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

233
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,700
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

234
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:25,820
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

235
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:31,780
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

236
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:36,700
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

237
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:40,060
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

238
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:42,620
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

239
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:45,620
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

240
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:52,140
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

241
00:11:52,620 --> 00:11:55,940
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

242
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:59,180
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

243
00:11:59,180 --> 00:12:05,940
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

244
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:09,220
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

245
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:12,660
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

246
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:14,780
♪Boundless♪
